WEBVTT

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:59.460
Blades aren't needed to kill men{commented because it's supposed to be typeset?}

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:16.610
Looks delicious...

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:26.330
Grilled pork on seafood special, Kimchi nattou on pork, egg and cheese.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:29.810
Still lots more coming up, please eat a lot.

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:32.590
Well then, I'll eat without reserve!

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:35.790
This... Delicious!

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:37.780
Delicious... This is the best.

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:39.840
Although I can't eat more than this,

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:43.130
I want to take the leftovers home, please.

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:49.980
C-Crap!

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:53.260
He won't come... Hayato-dono.

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:57.050
Calling us out so early in the morning during our day off, yet being late himself;

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:58.740
what's this supposed to mean?

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:04.430
I'm sure he's still sleeping,

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:06.730
dreaming about chomping down food.

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:11.030
But he created the Okonomiyaki Club and became the advisor,

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:13.440
he sure thinks like a monkey.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:18.330
Obviously he just wants to eat okonomiyaki for free and thus cut his food expenses.

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:21.100
It's terrible! Terrible!

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:25.180
It's awful.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.490
It's all flat.

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:28.890
According to my information,

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:31.420
somebody sneaked into the shop in the middle of the night,

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.600
and broke its main support pillar.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:36.890
By the way, the anti-quake strength of the shop is 8.5.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:36.890
Note: 8.5 on the Richter scale.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:40.270
Is the main pillar that fragile?

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:44.260
That would require the force of at least a million mice.

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:47.730
According to Mansaku-san who barely escaped,

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:50.850
he saw the shadows of an ominous monster running through the night.

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.290
Ominous monster...

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:56.870
It's just ahead, just ahead...

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:06.970
Sorry.

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:13.920
Sexy...

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:27.080
Hayato-dono.

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:30.490
Hayato-dono, are you all right?

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:33.130
Yup. Sorry for being late.

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:34.820
I just bumped into this person.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:37.070
Huh?

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:40.280
What?

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.040
Monjaya collapsed?

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:45.400
Also, an eyewitness reported seeing a flying monster.

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:49.740
Perhaps some weird ninja like before again?

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:52.740
If that's the case, I wonder why Monjaya's targeted.

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:57.000
If we don't know the aim of the enemy, it's as eerie as it gets.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:00.060
Where should we go?

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:03.630
That means we are temporary out of okonomiyaki.

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:06.170
Just when I finally set up the Okonomiyaki Research Society.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.520
Damn it.

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:08.750
You're worried about that?

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:09.910
If that's the case,

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:15.200
we change the "Okonomiyaki Research Society" into "Kaitenzushi Research Society."

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:15.200
Note: Kaitenzushi is sushi served on a conveyor belt, where the price of a dish depends on the color of the plates.

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.330
We could do that too...

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:19.900
Anyway, what matters most is not that.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:21.100
Who goes there?!

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:34.140
This is the fur of a flying squirrel?

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:44.830
About the current experiment's subject, I heard it was still incomplete.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:49.750
It still has some minor defects

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:52.390
but there is nothing to be concerned about.

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:04.040
I will introduce you to the new teacher of our school:

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:07.140
Musashibou-sensei, please.

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:18.400
Y-Yesterday's...

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.700
According to my information,

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:26.270
it looks like the person Hayato bumped into yesterday was the new teacher.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:31.390
By the way, if the person he bumped into was a transfer student,

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:34.960
the percentage of them to fall in love was 99.9%.

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.900
They will be clinging onto each other.

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:40.890
That reminds me, there was such a scene in The Shinobis' 16th installment,

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:44.540
"There is someone important near the temple of love."

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.170
Are you okay with that, Himawari?

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:55.390
I don't care whoever my master falls in love with, I am just protecting my master.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:59.470
Um...

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:04.060
From today onwards, she will be teaching general knowledge along with me.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:06.540
Musashibou Misa-sensei.

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:07.970
Please to meet you.

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:11.680
Pretty.

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:16.450
Feels like a matured lady.

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:19.690
My lessons constitute

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:24.560
the knowledge of using cosmetics and perfumes, and even techniques to seduce men.

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:28.010
I will teach them as general knowledge for women.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:32.930
A kunoichi must sometimes use her femininity as a weapon.

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:36.330
Please put my teachings to use when such a time comes.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.930
And of course during private times as well.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:43.040
Stay on the man's left side when walking together.

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:45.430
Use an upward glance when watching him.

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:48.780
Lucky underwear should not be too daring or too plain.

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:48.780
Note: "Lucky" underwear is underwear worn on special dates.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:51.280
It's full of useful information.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:54.370
That's a big difference from Hayato's lessons.

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:56.590
It's as boring as a zebra.

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:59.640
"Gyoku" means egg.

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:02.320
Note: Tamago (egg) is sometimes written as 玉子. 玉 is sometimes read as gyoku.

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.310
"Tsuyudaku" means additional soup.

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:02.320
"Negidaku" means more spring onion.

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:04.360
That's not true.

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:07.770
Hayato-dono's lessons are interesting and useful.

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:10.070
Hayato-dono.

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:15.920
Looks like he's not feeling too well.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:18.550
That's the look of a man falling in love.

00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:20.820
He fell for the "General Knowledge for Women."

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:24.310
That's because Hayato is also a man.

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:27.680
Everybody's here for lunch?

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:31.180
Hayato-dono, what are you thinking of? Dazing off like that...

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:38.860
About how we only realize something is important when we lose it...

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:41.970
Something... important?

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:46.080
There was a delicious okonomiyaki stall in my neighbourhood.

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:51.800
Near the apartment where I stayed before coming here, there was an okonomiyaki stall, too.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:54.550
I realize that the important thing I've lost...

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:56.740
...is okonomiyaki.

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:00.890
Okonomiyaki... I want it...

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.800
He fell in love with okonomiyaki.

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:04.180
Not Misa-sensei.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.820
Misa-sensei?

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:10.440
She really is sexy.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:12.960
Not like you girls. How to put it...

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:14.400
She bulges where she should.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.000
That's the sex appeal of a matured lady.

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:20.600
But that's that, and okonomiyaki is okonomiyaki.

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:23.840
Hayato-dono, if it's okay with you, have some onigiri.

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:24.780
Thanks!

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:30.980
Yam and cheese, cabbage and natto,

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:32.830
and for the secret flavor is my grandma's dried plum!

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.470
Hold on.

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:37.030
There is no dried plum in okonomiyaki.

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:39.090
That's not true.

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:41.790
It might turn out nice.

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:44.360
I am okay with normal okonomiyaki.

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:48.350
We will use things that are good for the body as its toppings.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:53.900
We will make our share later, this is for Hayato-dono...

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:53.890
I don't see it. Don't see. Don't see. See nothing....

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:01.510
I am... starving.

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:12.310
That reminds me of the dream that I saw last night,

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:16.800
that was the okonomiyaki shop near my house when I was small.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:18.380
What was the shop's name?

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:22.980
I think the okonomiyaki there was the best.

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:25.900
Who could it be this late?

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:30.820
W-What's wrong?

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:35.300
May I discuss tomorrow's lesson?

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:38.530
P-Please...

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.490
Tonight's a full moon.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:45.440
Y-Yes...

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:48.060
It's charming.

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:49.700
Very pretty.

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:50.700
Yeah.

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:54.530
The full moon somehow looks like okonomiyaki, doesn't it?

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:58.000
The mochi the rabbits are making looks just like the pork.

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:58.000
Note: This refers to the folktale of rabbits on the moon making mochi.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.960
Marikouji-sensei.

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:01.280
Yes?

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:05.430
Do you believe in fate?

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.930
W-Wait... Sensei...

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:13.040
Hayato-dono, I made your supper - okonomiyaki!

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.530
What's wrong?

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:23.860
Sorry, I just feel a bit sick. See you.

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:28.350
Hayato-dono, what happened?

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:33.370
Well, we were preparing for tomorrow's lesson...

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:39.620
What happenend?

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:48.240
A monster sneaked in when we were enjoying our okonomiyaki.

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:49.650
It was the flying squirrel monster.

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:51.380
Were you being assaulted?

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:53.760
It broke the window and ran away.

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:57.990
The monster that destroyed Mansaku-san's shop.

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:18.190
Looks like you still can't control your transformation willingly.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.180
Please forgive me.

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:23.080
Forget about Marikouji Hayato.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:25.000
Execute your mission.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:25.770
Yes.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.630
Musashibou-sensei.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:44.470
The classroom for water elemental techniques has been modified as you said.

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:46.260
Thank you.

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:48.520
Sorry for the sudden request.

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:52.430
No, I am happy to do it for you, Musashibou-sensei.

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:54.630
Please feel free to ask for any favors.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:59.260
There has been a saying that "Blades are not needed to kill a man."

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:01.630
Everybody, do you know the meaning of this phrase?

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:06.080
If we don't use blades, then push him down a cliff?

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.720
Blow him up with a bazooka.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:10.340
Feed him to a lion.

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:12.170
Poison him.

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:14.550
That's not what she means...

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:17.330
Yes. The method of killing is up to you.

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:22.040
But what's important is the way to catch them off guard and to bemuse them.

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:26.130
It is important to polish our feminine side in order to lead them by their noses.

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:30.090
That's why we're having this special skincare bath lesson.

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:34.290
I have prepared special bath additives that contained a lot of skincare ingredients.

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:37.750
Nice bath...

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.200
My skin is becoming smooth like boiled eggs.

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:43.760
Such lessons are welcomed like lambs.

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:47.900
What are you doing?

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:01.220
This is strange.

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:05.030
No good. It's not opening.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.660
Looks like it's locked from the outside.

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:09.560
Is there anything that can break the door?

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:12.250
Weapons and clothes are all outside.

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:15.040
Hey! Somebody open this. Somebody!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.600
Just drown to death inside.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:23.910
Could it be we were purposely trapped in here?

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:29.580
Nice bath~

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.020
Tsukiyohime...

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:37.860
It's exceptional to drink miso soup when soaking in a hot spring.

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:47.360
Although I have broken down the shop...

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:51.230
I am selling on a cart until the shop is repaired,

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:53.210
but the taste doesn't change.

00:14:55.320 --> 00:14:57.480
Would you like to have some okonomiyaki, sensei?

00:14:57.480 --> 00:14:58.980
It's delicious.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:13.760
So that's her!

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:17.040
Sensei is the flying squirrel monster?

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:19.640
But why does she transform when she sees okonomiyaki?

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:22.440
What reason is that?

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:27.500
I know that there are men that change into wolves during full moon.

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:30.800
Hayato-dono.

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:35.720
I am starving.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.290
The smell of Okonomiyaki...

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:42.410
That's too bad...

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:42.990
Huh?

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:45.480
Musashibou-sensei,

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:47.000
were you all right yesterday?

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:51.760
Marikouji-sensei, you are here at the right time.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:56.930
Let's continue where we left off yesterday.

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:59.560
What should we do? We are drowning.

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:02.230
We can't do anything naked and unarmed.

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:04.720
It's terrible like a giraffe!

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:06.920
If we don't act fast, Hayato-dono will...

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:08.540
We can't get out by going up.

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:11.310
Something small could possibly break this.

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:33.740
The continuation from yesterday... Here?

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:36.310
Yes. Since there's nobody here.

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:41.820
H-Hold on, Sensei. I am not mentally prepared for such a sudden...

00:16:41.820 --> 00:16:44.850
I mean... We are educationists...

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.620
Stay away from Hayato-dono!

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:08.700
S-Stop! Stay away!

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:16.780
It's you who turned me into this. It's all your fault.

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:21.390
What nonsense are you saying? I don't know anything!

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.710
What are you going to do to my master?

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:29.350
Himawari!

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:31.620
Don't disturb.

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:33.820
Come here.

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:09.330
You have some seaweed sticking to your tooth.

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:22.260
Why?! I haven't done anything wrong to you!

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:28.400
A single unintentional event can kill a maiden without blades.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.470
Micchan?

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:48.310
Your okonomiyaki

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:50.280
is really the best!

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:52.870
Sure,

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:54.740
I put in a lot of love.

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:59.790
You... You're Micchan from the okonomiyaki shop?

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:04.790
You finally remembered.

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:16.460
I wish I was born in an okonomiyaki shop.

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.950
Then I could eat it everyday.

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:21.890
You will sure be fed up with it if you eat it everyday.

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:23.760
I wonder.

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:26.230
You ate okonomiyaki this morning?

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:27.060
Yup.

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:29.780
You've got seaweed on your tooth.

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:43.280
I couldn't open my mouth and laugh since then.

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:45.860
I couldn't eat okonomiyaki anymore.

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:48.360
All that was your fault!

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:49.330
Wait.

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:51.620
That doesn't mean that this is just a misunderstanding?

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:54.040
But that is your fault.

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:55.640
Why?!

00:19:56.160 --> 00:20:00.690
If you are told that by the man you love, that hurts a girl.

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:02.960
It's embarassing to be criticized for her face.

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:11.440
Wait. It's my fault. I didn't know that could hurt you!

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:15.820
I like Micchan who laughs lively at all times.

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:17.210
It's nothing to do with seaweed!

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:19.440
What's wrong with that sticking on your tooth?

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:25.490
I liked the Micchan who liked okonomiyaki a lot, and opened her mouth widely and laughed lively.

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:38.410
But, I apologize for hurting you.

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:40.610
It was my fault. Please forgive me.

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:47.490
Himawari! It's dangerous.

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:50.850
My master's fault is my fault, too.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.500
I apologize as well.

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:53.790
Sorry.

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:56.740
Please somehow forgive Hayato-dono.

00:20:56.740 --> 00:20:57.870
Himawari.

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:12.210
I forgive you in deference of this girl.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:14.470
Thank you very much.

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:20.110
But the people who sent me here will send more ninja.

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:21.650
Take care.

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:22.750
What people...?

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:25.900
Goodbye, Hayato-kun.

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:37.480
You betrayed us.

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:42.610
Go. Transform again and execute your mission.

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:49.980
Looks like you somehow managed to control it.

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:51.650
That seems to be it.

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:52.520
Well then...

00:21:52.810 --> 00:21:56.160
I will take this okonomiyaki as my supper.

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:16.490
Now. Eat up!

00:22:17.570 --> 00:22:20.270
It's somehow a complicated feeling.

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:23.110
You can't eat okonomiyaki anymore?

00:22:24.780 --> 00:22:26.860
It's a trauma.

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:28.430
Is that so?

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:34.270
Delicious.

00:22:34.270 --> 00:22:35.810
This tastes good.

00:22:35.810 --> 00:22:37.970
That's good to hear.

00:22:42.740 --> 00:22:43.730
What's wrong?

00:22:45.190 --> 00:22:47.470
No...

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:49.050
Nothing at all.

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:52.240
Your okonomiyaki is the best.

00:24:11.410 --> 00:24:12.240
Eight, nine, ten!

00:24:13.560 --> 00:24:14.500
There you go!

00:24:15.020 --> 00:24:18.860
Himeji-san, using a machine gun in can-kicking is prohibited!

00:24:18.860 --> 00:24:22.130
No. Say no to violence!

00:24:22.130 --> 00:24:25.690
Huh? Himeji-san didn't come for can-kicking this morning?

00:24:26.340 --> 00:24:28.350
She was taken away by ninja?

00:24:28.350 --> 00:24:32.840
The ninja... But he's small and unnoticeable.

00:24:32.840 --> 00:24:33.710
Next time:

00:24:33.710 --> 00:24:35.530
"There's a fine line between attack and defense."

00:24:36.050 --> 00:24:39.010
Hayato-dono, who is the "important one"?
